stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> NoAccount: Get started
  [*] --> Cloud: Sign in or restore + Cloud
  state "Book without an account<br/>(Free or Pro, only on this phone)" as NoAccount
  state "Uploading<br/>adopted → retenanted → pushed" as Claim
  state "Under a free account<br/>(kept on this phone)" as Kept
  state "Cloud<br/>syncs, realtime" as Cloud
  state "Sync paused<br/>(everything stays and works)" as Paused
  state "Signed out<br/>(books kept, hidden)" as SignedOut
  NoAccount --> Claim: Back up and sync, sign in
  Claim --> Cloud: account has Cloud
  Claim --> Kept: account without Cloud, Keep it on this phone
  Kept --> Cloud: Cloud bought, upload starts by itself
  Cloud --> Paused: plan ends, last push and pull
  Paused --> Cloud: renewal, pushes the backlog, replays deletes
  Cloud --> SignedOut: log out
  SignedOut --> Cloud: Sign back in
